  "content": "\n\n<h2>手电筒+&nbsp;</h2>\n<p><strong>手电筒+</strong> 添加了高级手持和可穿戴照明工具，以改善您的夜间生存和探索体验<br>非常适合在黑暗中旅行、探索洞穴或漫步于令人毛骨悚然的废弃场所<br>旨在提供沉浸式光照体验，同时保持游戏平衡</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_8e017f85-5d99-432b-8c5d-680fa320cc2d.png\" width=\"606\" height=\"273\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>点亮你的冒险，不再畏惧黑暗</strong></h2>\n<p>本模组添加了</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_93a90baf-2fe9-4979-9717-3d8fe86d68c6.png\" width=\"254\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p>手电筒<br>定向光束，跟随你的视线方向<br>手持电池时右键点击即可充电</p>\n<p>头灯<br>解放双手的照明工具，适用于夜间采矿和探险<br>将头灯与电池一起放入铁砧中即可充电</p>\n<p>灯笼<br>可手持或放置的持续暖光源<br>电量耗尽后无法再次充电</p>\n<p>夜视镜&nbsp;<br>在完全无光的环境中也能清晰视物<br><br></p>\n<p>⚠️&nbsp;<strong>依赖项</strong><br>需要&nbsp;<strong>TCTCore</strong> (V5.2+) <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tct-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击下载</a></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xhJ_YRub4lI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_aaae6a95-296e-4267-9808-c06737fcfa56.png\" width=\"321\" height=\"151\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_76e218ff-5671-4b3b-8dc8-80cccc84e5bd.png\" width=\"321\" height=\"147\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_6c62c656-9836-49e6-8090-1470908408ca.png\" width=\"322\" height=\"152\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_71d435fb-3b53-4111-be28-f4b76c9b4a3e.png\" width=\"322\" height=\"179\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_58a55a00-bf87-4c02-b906-37c899d7d8fc.png\" width=\"323\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
